## 5. Known Limitations & Mitigations

|Limitation                     |Impact                                      |Mitigation                                                   |
|-------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
|Computer Use is ~72.5% accurate|1 in 4 visual tasks may fail or need retry  |Max iteration cap + fallback to API skills                   |
|Prompt injection via email     |Malicious email could hijack agent          |Sanitise all external content before injecting into context  |
|Google session expiry          |Agent locked out of Gmail/Drive             |Persistent Chrome profile + session health check every 30 min|
|No multi-tasking               |One task at a time per agent                |Task queue — clients are told “processing, ~2 min”           |
|macOS security popups          |Popups block the agent mid-task             |Pre-grant all permissions during provisioning                |
|API cost spikes                |One heavy client could cost $400+ in a month|Daily cost cap + Slack alert at 80% + hard cut at 120%       |
|Mac Mini power outage          |Agent offline until power restored          |UPS battery + heartbeat alert within 5 min                   |
|OpenClaw upstream changes      |Breaking changes break your product         |Locked fork — never auto-merge upstream                      |

